### ==============================================================================
### ملف تجربة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات: التقارير والتحليلات وحساب النتائج (REST Client)
### الشريحة الرابعة - Backend API (Slice 4 - Reports & Analytics)
### ==============================================================================
### ملاحظة أمنية: لا تحتوي هذه الوثيقة على أي كلمات مرور.
### يجب الحصول على الرمز (Token) وتعيينه في متغير {{token}} أدناه للمتابعة.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = your_bearer_token_here

@schoolId = 1
@assessmentId = 1
@standardId = 1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. لوحة معلومات المدرسة والتقييم (Dashboard)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: reports.view
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/dashboard HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1.1 لوحة المعلومات عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/dashboard HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. النتائج الكلية والتفصيلية للتقييم (Overall Assessment Results)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: reports.view
### ملاحظة: يشترط أن يكون التقييم مكتملاً (Completed أو Submitted أو Approved)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/results HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2.1 النتائج الكلية عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/results HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. نتائج معيار رئيسي ومجالاته ومؤشراته (Standard Breakdown Results)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: reports.view
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/standards/{{standardId}}/results HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3.1 نتائج معيار رئيسي عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/standards/{{standardId}}/results HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ملخص اكتمال الشواهد والأدلة (Evidence Completion Summary)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: reports.view
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/evidence-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.1 ملخص الشواهد عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/evidence-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ملخص وحالة خطط التحسين (Improvement Plans Summary & Delays)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: improvement.view
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/improvement-plans/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.1 ملخص خطط التحسين عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/improvement-plans/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. تصدير تقرير التقييم الكامل بصيغة JSON (Assessment Report JSON Export)
### الصلاحية المطلوبة: reports.export
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/export HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6.1 تصدير التقرير عبر المسار البديل (Alias)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schools/{{schoolId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/export HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
